      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think an \"Active Recently Visited Instances\" tab would be amazing, not just private, but I would like to re-join the same public instance I was just in as well.\n\nAs someone that has spotty internet and experiences crashes from time to time, it would be immensely useful to be able to re-join any still active instances that I've recently visited. I've been disconnected / crashed in the middle of a conversation with a nice stranger I was considering friends requesting a few times, but never saw them again because I couldn't get back in to the instance I was in.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-05T10:33:01.805Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having the ability to go on the worlds menu and having a menu to quickly get back into invite only instances would be helpful if someone had crashed out of VRChat and has to get back to the instance, especially if it's an event instance.",
